      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "recto, right",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>Abu\u02bel-Fakhr Levi the druggist one waraq</li>\n<li>his son Abu\u02bel-Fa\u1e0dl 1/2 and 1/3 waraq</li>\n<li>the sons of the dealer in odoriferous wood 1/2 and 1/3</li>\n<li>Ab\u016b \u02bfImr\u0101n Levi the druggist</li>\n<li>Ab\u016b \u02bfImr\u0101n Kohen the druggist 1/3</li>\n<li>[al]-Mevin b. Munajja the banker 1/3</li>\n<li>[al-Sa]d\u012bd Ab\u016b Na\u1e63r&nbsp; his neighbor 1</li>\n<li>al-Mak\u012bn b. al-Naf\u012bs (who) r(ests in) E(den) 1</li>\n<li>Abu\u02bel-\u1e24asan the money assayer 1/2 and 1/3</li>\n<li>R. Shemu\u02beel son of the judge (may his) m(emory be) b(lessed) 1/2 and 1/3</li>\n<li>al-[. . .] b. N\u0101j\u012b&nbsp; 1</li>\n<li>Ab\u016b Man\u1e63\u016br b. Naf\u012b\u02bf 1/3</li>\n<li>Ab\u016b \u02bfAl\u012b b. Karam 1</li>\n<li>B\u016b Man\u1e63\u016br the distributor of seeds1/2 and 1/3</li>\n<li>Bu\u02bel-\u02bfIzz the oculist 1</li>\n<li>Ab\u016b Man\u1e63\u016br son of the captive 1/2 and 1/3</li>\n<li>the Kohen b. al-Naj\u012bb the banker 1/4</li>\n<li>al-Thiqa Hiba, street of the greengrocers 1/3</li>\n<li>Bu\u02bel-\u02bfAl\u0101\u02be and his partner 1/3</li>\n<li>Mufa\u1e0d\u1e0dal the gold/silversmith and his son 1</li>\n<li>Ya\u02bfq\u016bb the seller [of food stuff] 1/4</li>\n<li>3 1/2</li>\n<li>Friday</li>\n<li>b. al-Naj\u012b[b] the herald 1</li>\n<li>al-Ra\u1e63u[y] b. al-Kohen 1</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
