          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "recto, left",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>the sons of the dealer in odoriferous wood [[1]] nuqra // 1 1/2 waraq //</li>\n<li>Fakhr al-Dawla Kohen 1</li>\n<li>the \u1e25aver Abu\u02bel-\u02bfAl\u0101\u02be 1/2</li>\n<li>al-Rash\u012bd Abu\u02bel-Fa\u1e0dl 1/2</li>\n<li>al-[Sa]d\u012bd Ab\u016b Na\u1e63r\u00a0 \u02bfAl\u012b 1/2</li>\n<li><del>Bu Man\u1e63\u016br b.</del> \u1e62af\u012b 1/2</li>\n<li>Shab\u012bb 1/2</li>\n<li>the sons of Naf\u012b\u02bf 1</li>\n<li>the sons of al-Lebd\u012b 1</li>\n<li>al-M[. . .] Samawwal 1/2</li>\n<li>Wal\u012b al-Dawla 1</li>\n<li>Bishr from RSTYH 1/2</li>\n<li>paid one waraq</li>\n<li>Sulaym\u0101n the dyer 1/2</li>\n<li>[. . .]</li>\n<li>al-T[. . .] 1</li></ol>\n",
